      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. i just took the sumatriptan. it's still hitting pretty hard though and i'm starting to feel a bit lightheaded and dizzy. my neck feels kinda stiff too. i'm really hoping it's just the migraine peaking and not something else... do you think it's normal to feel dizzy with a migraine this bad? i'd rather not go to the ER if i can help it, it's so expensive and a hassle.",
