      "content": "meningitis?? thats terrifying. i dont think i have a fever or anything though... i just feel like i'm in a lot of pain and the light is making it way worse. honestly if i go to the er they'll probably just tell me it's a migraine and charge me a fortune. can i just take some ibuprofen or maybe some more sumatriptan to see if i can sleep it off? i really just want to ride this out at home.",
